      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROUGH GIRL SLIM (1) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at Murray Bridge Straight over 300m behind Connector (17.45) in a Grade 6. Worth another chance. COMPTON BOWIE (2) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Can find the frame this time. MIRACLE MAN (5) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (22.95) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Has ability and is one of the better chances. MAGIC NANCY (4) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
